      "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/647a80504bd505f608d560a67466a03a.avif?t=1765421787\" width=615 height=67 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/12de4e8aff83df748fe72af02015c3be.poster.avif?t=1765421787\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/12de4e8aff83df748fe72af02015c3be.webm?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/12de4e8aff83df748fe72af02015c3be.mp4?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“The school’s like hell... It’s actually run by devils?!”</h2><br>Black Academy. An institution that forces its students to work.<br>Unfair treatment by seniors, overtime every day.<br>On top of that, teachers have private errands for students!<br><br>The students were inspired by the magical world and became magical girls. Will they put an end to the devils’ plan and clock out?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/e558678595882a86ed541b921b44be58.avif?t=1765421787\" width=615 height=67 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ Side-scrolling shooter + roguelite</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/566ed000b3f190a03dbaeb83df55199a.poster.avif?t=1765421787\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/566ed000b3f190a03dbaeb83df55199a.webm?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/566ed000b3f190a03dbaeb83df55199a.mp4?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Black Academy, collect various spells on different maps and level up in order to slay devils!<br>Exciting horizontal shooter &amp; roguelite game<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ Unique attacks by the magical girls!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/42618e1cb27e865efd1bc6162db21cb0.poster.avif?t=1765421787\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/42618e1cb27e865efd1bc6162db21cb0.webm?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/42618e1cb27e865efd1bc6162db21cb0.mp4?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore the maps to get various spells.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/deaf710f079ce7bd814b15bc2f00a0df.poster.avif?t=1765421787\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/deaf710f079ce7bd814b15bc2f00a0df.webm?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/deaf710f079ce7bd814b15bc2f00a0df.mp4?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose a spell that matches your play style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ Magical spells get stronger and stronger!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/419af7c0d69cfe095339d326b0c521ba.poster.avif?t=1765421787\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/419af7c0d69cfe095339d326b0c521ba.webm?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/419af7c0d69cfe095339d326b0c521ba.mp4?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Get power-up items to change magical spells into different shapes and forms.<br>Find new magical spells and check out how they level up.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ Cute magical world residents!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/a99c4d649fa6cbcf0f229d86097fd337.poster.avif?t=1765421787\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/a99c4d649fa6cbcf0f229d86097fd337.webm?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/a99c4d649fa6cbcf0f229d86097fd337.mp4?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each resident has a story and came into the devils’ barrier.<br>They’re a bit stubborn, but they’ll help you clock out.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ Blame the overtime on the powerful devils!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/cc3e9a53782a2e3e2955c9049017df80.poster.avif?t=1765421787\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/cc3e9a53782a2e3e2955c9049017df80.webm?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/